    "credit": "The original work is known as \"cave painting removal\" and it depicts a city council worker power-washing a prehistoric cave painting for a clean grey wall. D.V. Here's a quote of Banksy “The Art we look at is made by only a select few. A small group create, promote, purchase, exhibit and decide the success of Art. Only a few hundred people in the world have any real say. When you go to an Art gallery you are simply a tourist looking at the trophy cabinet of a few millionaires.” https://banksyexplained.com/cave-painting-removal-2008/",
